    "q-159349": {
      "dom_id": "step-q159349",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "The joint CDF of two continuous random variables $X$ and $Y,$ for $(x,y)\\in [0,1]\\times [0,1],$ is given by\n\n$$\nF(x,y)={log}_{2}⁡(1+x{y}^{2}).\n$$\n\nFind ${F}_{Y}(y),$ the marginal CDF of $Y,$ for $0\\le y\\le 1.$",
      "worked_solution": "The marginal CDF of $X$ is given by\n\n$$\n{F}_{Y}(y)=F(\\infty ,y)={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }F(x,y).\n$$\n\nTherefore, for $0\\le y\\le 1,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{F}_{Y}(y) & =F(\\infty ,y) \\\\  & =F(1,y) \\\\  & ={log}_{2}⁡(1+(1){y}^{2}) \\\\  & ={log}_{2}⁡(1+{y}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-159349-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "1-{log}_{2}⁡(2-{y}^{3})",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"80\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c67\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.241em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-159349-b",
